yEAUxePcw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young man is plunged into a life of subterfuge, deceit and mistaken identity in pursuit of a femme fatale whose heart is never quite within his grasp.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":682507,\"title\":\"Where the Crawdads Sing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n1el846gLDXfhOvrRCsyvaAOQWv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fsHxHpREPdE299Bl7RvKb1HKk9U.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Abandoned by her family, Kya raises herself all alone in the marshes outside of her small town. When her former boyfriend is found dead, Kya is instantly branded by the local townspeople and law enforcement as the prime suspect for his murder.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1173558,\"title\":\"Burning Betrayal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3MxgXI3VO7QCNnP0mPBjxLIemNM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a65WMR49PnWmSaCzaCyMNNHKQfn.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Babi discovers a betrayal by her long-term partner and decides to embark on a new adventure in life. On this journey, she meets judge Marco and they begin to live a story permeated by a lot of sexual tension.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11208,\"title\":\"Wicker Park\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gRKEluSpV1wBrZVTvLLaCSkzqcf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ogBcoLNyfwvgfWtEmNhjL8kBZN2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matthew, a young advertising executive in Chicago, puts his life and a business trip to China on hold when he thinks he sees Lisa, the love of his life who left him without a word two years earlier, walking out of a restaurant one day.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":28308,\"title\":\"The Body\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lCTA1B2oFev0bcXVZZuh93qDjix.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wytfOgPzYnYUqEbXUyM38HIcYXP.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An ancient skeleton has been discovered in Jerusalem in a rich man's tomb. Colouration of the wrist and leg bones indicates the cause of death was crucifiction. other signs, include a gold coin bearing the marks of Pontius Pilate and faint markings around the skull, lead authorities to suspect that these could be the bones of Jesus Christ. Politicians, clerics, religious extremists and those using terror as a means to an end, find their beliefs and identities tested while risking their lives to unearth the truth.....\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13944,\"title\":\"Passengers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gt7nwosQg6hfQXBcrNkiJPB45qe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a2oBd4B7x7Di8CVkDGCKcvy4TFm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a plane crash, a young therapist, Claire, is assigned by her mentor to counsel the flight's five survivors. When they share their recollections of the incident -- which some say include an explosion that the airline claims never happened -- Claire is intrigued by Eric, the most secretive of the passengers.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":137321,\"title\":\"Winter's Tale\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sdmHGy9c92SjAhz1h05TSLfnnAj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/IdrHHTC2QcrWUnEqshutR8L4vj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A burglar falls for an heiress as she dies in his arms. When he learns that he has the gift of reincarnation, he sets out to save her.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":286565,\"title\":\"Paper Towns\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lVW67w7eWwmBhbBCc4f983pO8m6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mwoIzHsliirmS0IlSrf2DvVouid.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Quentin Jacobsen has spent a lifetime loving the magnificently adventurous Margo Roth Spiegelman from afar. So when she cracks open a window and climbs back into his life dressed like a ninja and summoning him for an ingenious campaign of revenge, he follows. After their all-nighter ends and a new day breaks, Quentin arrives at school to discover that Margo, always an enigma, has now become a mystery. But Quentin soon learns that there are clues, and they're for him. Urged down a disconnected path, the closer Quentin gets, the less he sees of the girl he thought he knew.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10491,\"title\":\"Enigma\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7gBFkDYBqvSzrPOWlpGTXRp97NQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pE334YKo9NNgee3VEGl6VR6gGSZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of the WWII project to crack the code behind the Enigma machine, used by the Germans to encrypt messages sent to their submarines.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":353066,\"title\":\"The Vanishing of Sidney Hall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e8SJJEliAK9g0EG5agPsbxWoWoI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tFtqdDndzsQyymIR4fGbC77HVXJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Over the course of 12 years, and three stages of life, Sidney Hall falls in love, writes the book of a generation and then disappears without a trace.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20616,\"title\":\"Swimfan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mOAiqOivdVecMu0yhumN6pzDWmo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/asYdN1eS7zvkEJVIQaYqQcqssj6.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben Cronin has it all: the admiration of his many friends, a terrific girlfriend, and he's on the fast-track to an athletic scholarship. Ben's rock-solid, promising future and romance are turned upside-down with the arrival of Madison Bell. Madison, the new girl in town, quickly sets her sights on the impressionable Ben. While their first few meetings are innocent enough, the obsessive and seductive Madison wants more ... much more.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":376134,\"title\":\"The Discovery\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nLIDouFvreSrs8xK62zuvpEPDw0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dA7YLnc5ztTGiVPWz3GsaMRRz9r.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the near future, due to a breakthrough scientific discovery by Dr. Thomas Harbor, there is now definitive proof of an afterlife. While countless people have chosen suicide to reset their existence, others try to decide what it all means. Among them is Dr. Harbor's son Will, who has arrived at his father's isolated compound with a mysterious young woman named Isla. There, they discover the strange acolytes who help Dr. Harbor with his experiments.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"3tGempukqAg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9WBGcuMuDTk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"NcmLOsS8Wv0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}